01:26:46.828 --> 01:26:47.228
Thank you.

01:26:48.940 --> 01:26:49.400
You're welcome.

01:27:16.988 --> 01:27:17.608
You did good.

01:27:19.548 --> 01:27:20.548
90's sweetheart

01:27:20.668 --> 01:27:21.168
You too.

01:27:21.388 --> 01:27:21.568
Oh.

01:27:27.196 --> 01:27:29.196
The Maybe Shadow made it through the Fractal Core 2!

01:27:40.172 --> 01:27:41.172
We target the accelerator.

01:27:41.676 --> 01:27:43.956
Its energy will be released and the Lex will be destroyed.

01:27:44.332 --> 01:27:44.892
Targeted.

01:28:00.120 --> 01:28:02.260
has directed its ocular parabola at us at Rome.

01:28:03.380 --> 01:28:04.700
But Lex is not permitted

01:28:04.700 --> 01:28:07.380
to fire on his shadow's list.

01:28:30.000 --> 01:28:32.770
But Lex, that was one of his shadow ships.

01:28:35.140 --> 01:28:36.980
Who is his shadow?

01:28:37.280 --> 01:28:41.320
I perceive that much of Lex's memory was erased when we passed through the fractal core.

01:28:42.040 --> 01:28:43.460
That's what I call a positive development.

01:28:43.940 --> 01:28:45.520
I say we don't waste any time.

01:28:45.700 --> 01:28:49.440
We turn the Lex around and blow the cluster into little tiny shadow bits right now.

01:28:51.050 --> 01:28:51.990
Okay, propeller head.

01:28:52.560 --> 01:28:54.140
Let's find the course back to the cluster.

01:28:54.860 --> 01:28:57.080
I have no knowledge of this area, love dumpling.

01:28:57.990 --> 01:28:59.450
What kind of robot are you?

01:28:59.650 --> 01:28:59.970
I'm a robot.

01:29:00.000 --> 01:29:02.180
You're a robot that wants to live in your underpants.

01:29:02.850 --> 01:29:05.630
And I have knowledge of all sectors of our universe.

01:29:06.300 --> 01:29:09.240
But I have no knowledge of this sector, Angel Breath.

01:29:17.520 --> 01:29:18.740
Welcome to the Dark Zone.

01:29:20.620 --> 01:29:21.140
The Dark Zone?

01:29:22.380 --> 01:29:23.980
We're in the Dark Zone?

01:29:28.970 --> 01:29:29.430
So...

01:29:30.800 --> 01:29:32.040
What are we supposed to do now?

01:29:35.060 --> 01:29:36.740
Perhaps you should find yourselves a home.

01:29:38.380 --> 01:29:42.780
But the Dark Zone is full of depravity and evilness and darkness.

01:29:43.020 --> 01:29:44.600
My ancestors came from the Dark Zone.

01:29:45.300 --> 01:29:47.960
I was taught that although there are not many good planets, there are some.

01:29:49.310 --> 01:29:50.310
Perhaps you should find one.

01:29:52.790 --> 01:29:54.420
You mean we should find one?

01:29:55.200 --> 01:29:56.400
We're together in this.

01:29:57.470 --> 01:29:57.950
I'm dead.

01:30:00.120 --> 01:30:01.020
I have no future.

01:30:12.720 --> 01:30:14.640
Proto-Blood will not sustain me for much longer.

01:30:15.690 --> 01:30:18.310
Be certain of your need before you choose to reanimate me.

01:30:20.000 --> 01:30:22.720
In the light universe, I have been darkness.

01:30:24.910 --> 01:30:25.990
Perhaps in the dark zone.

01:31:00.000 --> 01:31:07.650
As you command, God.

01:31:39.120 --> 01:31:42.460
Your sisters will avenge you.
